  "incident_summary": "Windows workstation DESKTOP-H8ALZBV (10.8.15.133) in the lafontainebleu.org domain is infected with a commodity RAT malware family, likely Poison Ivy. The malware established persistent C2 communication to 72.5.43.29:80 via repeated HTTP beaconing with spoofed MSIE 6.0 user agent, received a DLL payload from the C2 server, and exfiltrated data via POST requests. Initial compromise vector appears to be delivery through spoofed FedEx phishing domains (quote.checkfedexexp.com, business.checkfedexexp.com)."
